    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d910">

                <pb facs="0943" n="823" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg823"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Japanese Minister to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Japan</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-10-16"><hi rendition="#italic">October 16,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 62.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to your conversation on Thursday,
                    the 12th instant, I have the honor to inform you that I have received this
                    morning a telegram from His Majesty’s minister for foreign affairs, advising
                    that the French minister at Tokyo handed him yesterday, the 15th instant,
                    notification regarding ratification of the treaty of peace by His Majesty the
                    Emperor of Russia.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">K. Takahira.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
